  146: 
  147: 	    It is not merely undefined, it is WRONG: -9 does not stay inside
  148: 	    its 3-bit field. ARM1136JSR1 yielded 0xffdea0ea where 0x0b02a0ea
  149: 	    is correct, smearing 0xf4dc0000 across the CLASS and HARVARD
  150: 	    fields as well.
