codex
Two concrete design risks have surfaced: the proposed coarse table at `0x5000` overlaps the 16 KiB L1 table, and an abort’s executed path includes the vector branch before the handler—so a valid `step N` cannot be derived from “arming + stimulus + handler” alone. I’m now checking the translated-load PC synchronization and whether identical handlers would mask a wrong vector.
